Prefer ordinary, low-risk, source-verifiable interactions as the first tests. For destructive/synthetic tests, use temporary distinct records with clear TEST designation, short expiry, and verified cleanup. Never run attacks against private records or mix experiments into a Flipped character's control without separate authorization. Platform inability to read/write is a connection limitation, not proof that a character has forgotten.


